1. PostgreSQL (https://www.postgresql.org/, https://github.com/postgres/postgres)
------------------------------------------------------------------------

Material ported (fetched from the master branch on 2026-10-16):

  * src/backend/parser/scan.l
      -> lib/src/sql/sql_lexer.dart, lib/src/sql/sql_char_classes.dart
         (lexical rules: numbers incl. PG16 junk rules, operators,
         comments, strings, dollar quotes, identifiers)
  * src/fe_utils/psqlscan.l
      -> lib/src/sql/sql_statement_splitter.dart
         (paren_depth / begin_depth statement boundaries, initial-keyword
         tracking, COPY ... FROM STDIN detection)
  * src/include/parser/kwlist.h
      -> lib/src/sql/sql_keyword_table.dart (generated by
         tool/generate_keywords.dart)
  * src/interfaces/libpq/t/001_uri.pl
      -> test/third_party/libpq_uri_corpus_test.dart (63 test cases)

